{"created":1789646336,"minutes":43200,"value":[{"id":"urn:li:ugcPost:7505497043067658240","commentary":"Deset pater nad Brnem. V jednom z v\u011b\u017e\u00e1k\u016f na \u0160umavsk\u00e9 jsme dokon\u010dili kancel\u00e1\u0159e Ork\u00e1nu.\n\nNa samotnou realizaci jsme m\u011bli dva t\u00fddny. Kr\u00e1tk\u00fd term\u00edn ale nem\u011bl znamenat rychl\u00e9 provizorium. Za tu dobu bylo pot\u0159eba sladit n\u00e1bytek na m\u00edru s typov\u00fdm vybaven\u00edm, zvl\u00e1dnout mont\u00e1\u017e a p\u0159edat hotov\u00fd prostor tak, jak byl navr\u017een\u00fd.\n\n\u010cern\u00e9 prvky konstrukce, kter\u00e9 jsou sou\u010d\u00e1st\u00ed budovy, jsme neskr\u00fdvali. Pracovali jsme s nimi d\u00e1l a jejich tvar se objevil t\u0159eba v polic\u00edch u barov\u00e9 kuchy\u0148ky i v \u010d\u00e1sti n\u00e1bytku vyroben\u00e9ho na m\u00edru.\n\nSpole\u010dn\u00e9 z\u00e1zem\u00ed dostalo v\u00fdraznou modrou, kter\u00e1 vych\u00e1z\u00ed z vizu\u00e1ln\u00ed identity Ork\u00e1nu. Dopl\u0148uje ji oran\u017eov\u00fd koberec, sv\u011btl\u00e9 d\u0159evo a \u010dern\u00e9 prvky konstrukce. D\u00edky v\u00fd\u0161ce budovy se nav\u00edc prostor otev\u00edr\u00e1 do \u0161irok\u00e9ho v\u00fdhledu na Brno.\n\nPracovn\u00ed m\u00edsta jsme vybavili na\u0161\u00edm n\u00e1bytkem Only1 a tam, kde typov\u00e9 \u0159e\u0161en\u00ed nesta\u010dilo, ho doplnili n\u00e1bytkem na m\u00edru. Pracovn\u00ed \u010d\u00e1st, zasedac\u00ed m\u00edstnost i spole\u010dn\u00e9 z\u00e1zem\u00ed tak dr\u017e\u00ed pohromad\u011b jako jeden celek.\n\nZa projektem stoj\u00ed t\u00fdm @[U1 space design](urn:li:organization:18790224). @[Andrea Kali\u0161ov\u00e1](urn:li:person:hA-dswfM-j) m\u011bla na starosti obchodn\u00ed \u010d\u00e1st projektu, @[Veronika Muzik\u00e1\u0159ov\u00e1](urn:li:person:SmE2P7YYr8) n\u00e1vrh interi\u00e9ru, @[Martin \u010cuhel](urn:li:person:cdBQPHYU6n) projektov\u00e9 veden\u00ed a koordinaci realizace a @[Romana Ko\u010dkov\u00e1](urn:li:person:FUntHYVBv\\_) rozpo\u010dty a objedn\u00e1vky.\n\nU dvout\u00fddenn\u00ed realizace nen\u00ed moc prostoru \u010dekat, a\u017e si jednotliv\u00e9 profese p\u0159edaj\u00ed pr\u00e1ci jedna po druh\u00e9. U n\u00e1s se obchod, design, projektov\u00e9 veden\u00ed, rozpo\u010dty i realizace ne\u0159e\u0161\u00ed odd\u011blen\u011b. Ka\u017edou z t\u011bchto \u010d\u00e1st\u00ed m\u00e1 na starosti n\u011bkdo z jednoho t\u00fdmu, tak\u017ee mohly b\u011b\u017eet soub\u011b\u017en\u011b. I d\u00edky tomu se poda\u0159ilo kancel\u00e1\u0159e p\u0159edat v term\u00ednu a v podob\u011b, v jak\u00e9 byly navr\u017een\u00e9.\n\nD\u011bkujeme cel\u00e9mu t\u00fdmu Ork\u00e1nu za d\u016fv\u011bru a spolupr\u00e1ci, kter\u00e1 takhle kr\u00e1tk\u00fd term\u00edn umo\u017enila.\n\n{hashtag|\\#|u1spacedesign} {hashtag|\\#|fitout} {hashtag|\\#|officedesign} {hashtag|\\#|brno}","media_url":"https:\/\/media.licdn.com\/dms\/image\/v2\/D4D22AQH0_6qF2IuwFg\/feedshare-image-high-res\/B4DaCjhxhzJUAU-\/0\/1789449935482?e=1791417600&v=beta&t=YtCISk8cYgC-mcWUdYjwqlXrI5s7qtYPpxDsBC3Za5A","createdAt":1789449940735},{"id":"urn:li:ugcPost:7499899760984883200","commentary":"Materi\u00e1l, na kter\u00fd se ve v\u00fdrob\u011b nav\u00edj\u00ed pap\u00edr, dnes v \u017dimrovic\u00edch pom\u00e1h\u00e1 dr\u017eet akustiku cel\u00e9ho kancel\u00e1\u0159sk\u00e9ho patra.\n\nPro @[Smurfit Westrock](urn:li:organization:98671778) jsme dokon\u010dili druh\u00e9 podla\u017e\u00ed administrativn\u00edch prostor v budov\u011b ze sedmdes\u00e1t\u00fdch let. Cht\u011bli jsme vytvo\u0159it prost\u0159ed\u00ed, ze kter\u00e9ho bude jasn\u00e9, komu pat\u0159\u00ed a kde se nach\u00e1z\u00ed.\n\nJedn\u00edm z hlavn\u00edch motiv\u016f se proto stal materi\u00e1l p\u0159\u00edmo z v\u00fdroby. Pap\u00edrov\u00e9 dutinky jsme vyu\u017eili jako akustick\u00e9 prvky na st\u011bn\u00e1ch i ve strop\u011b. Jejich podobu ladil n\u00e1\u0161 \u0161\u00e9fdesign\u00e9r @[Radek Ma\u0161inda](urn:li:person:L3tw2Wy41x) spole\u010dn\u011b s t\u00fdmem obalov\u00fdch design\u00e9r\u016f @[Smurfit Westrock](urn:li:organization:98671778).\n\nD\u016fle\u017eitou roli hraje i samotn\u00e9 m\u00edsto. Z oken je v\u00fdhled na les a \u0159eku, kter\u00e1 pap\u00edrnu z\u00e1sobuje vodou u\u017e od jej\u00edho zalo\u017een\u00ed. P\u0159\u00edvodn\u00ed Weisshuhn\u016fv kan\u00e1l je dnes n\u00e1rodn\u00ed technickou pam\u00e1tkou.\n\nM\u00edsto abychom nechali v\u00fdhled lidem za z\u00e1dy, vytvo\u0159ili jsme u oken m\u00edsta k sezen\u00ed. Z okna jsme tak ud\u011blali \u017eiv\u00fd obraz, kter\u00fd se b\u011bhem dne prom\u011b\u0148uje.\n\nInteri\u00e9r dopl\u0148uje sv\u011btl\u00e9 d\u0159evo a modrozelen\u00e1 na kuchy\u0148ce a recepci. Pracovn\u00ed m\u00edsta jsme vybavili n\u00e1bytkem Only1 a v zasedac\u00ed m\u00edstnosti vznikl tak\u00e9 samostatn\u00fd akustick\u00fd box pro hovory nebo neru\u0161enou pr\u00e1ci.\n\nZa projektem stoj\u00ed t\u00fdm @[U1 space design](urn:li:organization:18790224). @[Jaroslav Graf](urn:li:person:vX-OmyKbLx) m\u011bl na starosti obchodn\u00ed \u010d\u00e1st projektu, @[Tom\u00e1\u0161 Hel\u00e1n](urn:li:person:wlBns03aT2) projektov\u00e9 veden\u00ed a koordinaci realizace, @[Radek Ma\u0161inda](urn:li:person:L3tw2Wy41x) n\u00e1vrh cel\u00e9ho interi\u00e9ru a @[Petra Leblov\u00e1](urn:li:person:SGce9iW61Y) rozpo\u010dty a objedn\u00e1vky.\n\nNa t\u00e9hle realizaci se n\u00e1m l\u00edb\u00ed hlavn\u011b to, \u017ee jej\u00ed charakter vych\u00e1z\u00ed p\u0159\u00edmo z firmy, jej\u00ed v\u00fdroby, budovy i m\u00edsta, kde funguje.\n\nD\u00edky tomu by tenhle interi\u00e9r jen t\u011b\u017eko mohl pat\u0159it n\u011bkomu jin\u00e9mu.\n\nCel\u00fd projekt vznikl d\u00edky spolupr\u00e1ci na\u0161eho t\u00fdmu a @[Smurfit Westrock](urn:li:organization:98671778) pod veden\u00edm @[Kostas Canaklis](urn:li:person:xLSz2SsfUf). D\u00edky za d\u016fv\u011bru a otev\u0159enost hledat \u0159e\u0161en\u00ed, kter\u00e1 maj\u00ed vztah p\u0159\u00edmo k m\u00edstu i samotn\u00e9 v\u00fdrob\u011b.\n\nKter\u00fd prvek v\u00e1s zaujal nejv\u00edc?\n\nFotografie: @[Jan Kudej](urn:li:person:BtYqOiFjg9)\n{hashtag|\\#|u1spacedesign} {hashtag|\\#|fitout} {hashtag|\\#|interiordesign} {hashtag|\\#|smurfit}","media_url":"https:\/\/media.licdn.com\/dms\/image\/v2\/D4D22AQFjvihqO7yQWQ\/feedshare-image-high-res\/B4DaBT_FcMKcAU-\/0\/1788115441913?e=1791417600&v=beta&t=FjkWGCs3nJXQRTOXiHzL46D1omTutDmnVvWNMqdiIKc","createdAt":1788115444692},{"id":"urn:li:ugcPost:7494985930278248448","commentary":"Pokra\u010dujeme v realizaci pro @[Smurfit Westrock](urn:li:organization:98671778)  v \u017dimrovic\u00edch, \u010desk\u00fd z\u00e1vod jednoho z nejv\u011bt\u0161\u00edch sv\u011btov\u00fdch v\u00fdrobc\u016f pap\u00edrov\u00fdch obal\u016f.\n\nDokon\u010dili jsme druh\u00e9 podla\u017e\u00ed administrativn\u00edch prostor a dal\u0161\u00ed \u010d\u00e1st projektu se tak z prvn\u00edch n\u00e1vrh\u016f a vizualizac\u00ed prom\u011bnila v hotov\u00fd interi\u00e9r.\n\nJedn\u00edm z v\u00fdrazn\u00fdch prvk\u016f nov\u00fdch kancel\u00e1\u0159\u00ed jsou skl\u00e1dan\u00e9 prvky z materi\u00e1lu, kter\u00fd firma pou\u017e\u00edv\u00e1 ve vlastn\u00ed v\u00fdrob\u011b. V interi\u00e9ru maj\u00ed nejen vizu\u00e1ln\u00ed, ale tak\u00e9 akustickou funkci a z\u00e1rove\u0148 p\u0159irozen\u011b propojuj\u00ed pracovn\u00ed prost\u0159ed\u00ed s firemn\u00ed identitou.\n\nNa n\u00e1vrhu jejich tvaru a celkov\u00e9ho \u0159e\u0161en\u00ed jsme spolupracovali s t\u00fdmem obalov\u00fdch design\u00e9r\u016f. Firma n\u00e1sledn\u011b jednotliv\u00e9 prvky sama vyrobila a dodala.\n\nSou\u010d\u00e1st\u00ed n\u00e1vrhu bylo tak\u00e9 zachov\u00e1n\u00ed p\u016fvodn\u00edho charakteru budovy ze 70. let. V interi\u00e9ru proto z\u016fstaly nap\u0159\u00edklad odhalen\u00e9 betonov\u00e9 nosn\u00edky, kter\u00e9 jsme za\u010dlenili do nov\u00e9ho \u0159e\u0161en\u00ed.\n\nJak na v\u00e1s prostor p\u016fsob\u00ed?","media_url":"https:\/\/media.licdn.com\/dms\/image\/v2\/D4D05AQEXARSViyRpxg\/videocover-high\/B4DaAOKRpoGYBQ-\/0\/1786943973332?e=1790251200&v=beta&t=tREcdD_Ih5qoIC0Q_tK8IDwZj2GV744QDmszR2hdr9U","createdAt":1786943896178},{"id":"urn:li:ugcPost:7489919257930063872","commentary":"Je to bezpe\u010dn\u00e9? \n\nP\u0159es den staveni\u0161t\u011b. Ve\u010der zahr\u00e1dka restaurace.\n\nO p\u00e1r ulic d\u00e1l p\u0159itom stejn\u00fd Bangkok schov\u00e1v\u00e1 celou stavbu za n\u011bkolik metr\u016f vysokou plechovou br\u00e1nu. Jedno m\u011bsto, dv\u011b stavby a \u00fapln\u011b jin\u00fd vztah k prostoru kolem.\n\nNa profilu U1 v\u011bt\u0161inou ukazujeme hotov\u00e9 realizace. Tentokr\u00e1t p\u0159id\u00e1v\u00e1me post\u0159eh z cesty na\u0161eho marke\u0165\u00e1ka @[Jakub Boh\u00e1\u010dek](urn:li:person:Y9tsxMSYYO), kter\u00e9ho v Bangkoku zaujalo, jak rozd\u00edln\u011b m\u016f\u017ee stavba fungovat vedle ka\u017edodenn\u00edho \u017eivota.\n\nJedno staveni\u0161t\u011b bylo kompletn\u011b uzav\u0159en\u00e9 vysok\u00fdm nepr\u016fhledn\u00fdm oplocen\u00edm. Vstup tvo\u0159ila n\u011bkolikametrov\u00e1 plechov\u00e1 br\u00e1na s kontroln\u00edm stanovi\u0161t\u011bm, informa\u010dn\u00edmi tabulemi a bezpe\u010dnostn\u00edm zna\u010den\u00edm. Z ulice nebylo t\u00e9m\u011b\u0159 vid\u011bt, co se uvnit\u0159 d\u011bje. Stavba fungovala jako samostatn\u00fd prostor jasn\u011b odd\u011blen\u00fd od m\u011bsta.\n\nJen o p\u00e1r ulic d\u00e1l prob\u00edhaly pr\u00e1ce p\u0159\u00edmo uprost\u0159ed b\u011b\u017en\u00e9ho provozu. V parku, na chodn\u00edku, vedle p\u011btiproud\u00e9 silnice nebo p\u0159ed restauracemi, kter\u00e9 z\u016fst\u00e1valy otev\u0159en\u00e9. Na jednom m\u00edst\u011b byla rozkopan\u00e1 \u010d\u00e1st ulice, pravd\u011bpodobn\u011b kv\u016fli nov\u00e9 komunikaci nebo technick\u00e9 infrastruktu\u0159e. P\u0159es den zde pracovali d\u011bln\u00edci. Ve\u010der restaurace do stejn\u00e9ho prostoru postavila stoly a otev\u0159ela zahr\u00e1dku. Po zav\u00edrac\u00ed dob\u011b v\u0161e sklidila a r\u00e1no mohly pr\u00e1ce pokra\u010dovat.\n\nNejde o porovn\u00e1v\u00e1n\u00ed toho, co je spr\u00e1vn\u011b a co \u0161patn\u011b. Sp\u00ed\u0161 o uk\u00e1zku, \u017ee i v jednom m\u011bst\u011b mohou n\u011bkolik ulic od sebe fungovat dva \u00fapln\u011b odli\u0161n\u00e9 p\u0159\u00edstupy k bezpe\u010dnosti, stavebn\u00ed logistice a okoln\u00edmu provozu. N\u011bkde se stavba od m\u011bsta maxim\u00e1ln\u011b odd\u011bl\u00ed. Jinde se na \u010d\u00e1st dne stane jeho p\u0159irozenou sou\u010d\u00e1st\u00ed.\n\nProto\u017ee stavba nen\u00ed jen hotov\u00fd v\u00fdsledek. Je to tak\u00e9 zp\u016fsob, jak\u00fdm realizace po celou dobu funguje vedle lid\u00ed, dopravy, restaurac\u00ed a \u017eivota kolem.\n\n{hashtag|\\#|u1spacedesign} {hashtag|\\#|construction} {hashtag|\\#|stavebnilogistika}","media_url":"https:\/\/media.licdn.com\/dms\/image\/v2\/D5622AQHmKns_kSP2eA\/feedshare-shrink_1280\/B56Z_GJ3mdIcAY-\/0\/1785735905314?e=1791417600&v=beta&t=DCWXFenyJB7wrug7QZ1R9QLJHWFjbPp4P3zZs9kcavY","createdAt":1785735907289},{"id":"urn:li:share:7487360260068888576","commentary":"86 minut denn\u011b.\nTolik m\u016f\u017ee zam\u011bstnanec ztratit kv\u016fli vyru\u0161ov\u00e1n\u00ed v kancel\u00e1\u0159i. Nejv\u011bt\u0161\u00edm probl\u00e9mem p\u0159itom \u010dasto nen\u00ed samotn\u00fd hluk. Je to ciz\u00ed v\u011bta, kter\u00e9 rozum\u00edte. \\(Steelcase a Ipsos\\)\n\nPro pr\u00e1ci n\u00e1ro\u010dnou na pozornost je hygienick\u00fd limit 50 dB. B\u011b\u017en\u00e1 kancel\u00e1\u0159 se podle provozu pohybuje p\u0159ibli\u017en\u011b mezi 55 a 70 dB. To ale neznamen\u00e1, \u017ee je open space \u0161patn\u011b. Naopak. Pro rychlou komunikaci, sd\u00edlen\u00ed n\u00e1pad\u016f a spolupr\u00e1ci t\u00fdmu funguje skv\u011ble. Probl\u00e9m vznik\u00e1 a\u017e tehdy, kdy\u017e v n\u011bm chyb\u00ed akustick\u00e9 \u0159e\u0161en\u00ed a m\u00edsta pro soust\u0159ed\u011bnou pr\u00e1ci.\n\nMozek si dok\u00e1\u017ee zvyknout na rovnom\u011brn\u00fd zvuk vzduchotechniky, ale srozumiteln\u00fd rozhovor automaticky p\u0159it\u00e1hne jeho pozornost. Proto v\u00e1s m\u016f\u017ee kolega u k\u00e1vovaru vyru\u0161it v\u00edc ne\u017e objektivn\u011b hlu\u010dn\u011bj\u0161\u00ed technika.\n\nV n\u00e1vrhu kancel\u00e1\u0159e proto pracujeme se t\u0159emi principy: \npohltit, odd\u011blit a zamaskovat. \nAkustick\u00e9 panely, podhledy, koberce a \u010daloun\u011bn\u00ed omezuj\u00ed odrazy zvuku. Focus z\u00f3ny vytv\u00e1\u0159ej\u00ed klidn\u011bj\u0161\u00ed m\u00edsta pro pr\u00e1ci, kter\u00e1 vy\u017eaduje hlub\u0161\u00ed soust\u0159ed\u011bn\u00ed. Odhlu\u010dn\u011bn\u00e9 telefonn\u00ed a pracovn\u00ed budky zase umo\u017e\u0148uj\u00ed vy\u0159\u00eddit call, online sch\u016fzku nebo n\u00e1ro\u010dn\u011bj\u0161\u00ed \u00fakol bez ru\u0161en\u00ed okol\u00ed.\n\nDobr\u00e1 akustika neza\u010d\u00edn\u00e1 n\u00e1kupem nejdra\u017e\u0161\u00edch panel\u016f. Za\u010d\u00edn\u00e1 pochopen\u00edm toho, kde lid\u00e9 spolupracuj\u00ed, kde telefonuj\u00ed a kde pot\u0159ebuj\u00ed klid. Nejl\u00e9pe funguje, kdy\u017e se \u0159e\u0161\u00ed u\u017e od prvn\u00ed skici a p\u0159irozen\u011b se prop\u00ed\u0161e do dispozice, stropu, n\u00e1bytku i jednotliv\u00fdch pracovn\u00edch z\u00f3n.\n\nAkustika je jedin\u00e1 slo\u017eka interi\u00e9ru, kterou na fotografii neuvid\u00edte. V dob\u0159e navr\u017een\u00e9 kancel\u00e1\u0159i ji ale pozn\u00e1te okam\u017eit\u011b. T\u00edm, \u017ee open space podporuje spolupr\u00e1ci, ale z\u00e1rove\u0148 v n\u011bm ka\u017ed\u00fd najde m\u00edsto, kde se m\u016f\u017ee soust\u0159edit.\n\nDa\u0159\u00ed se u v\u00e1s v kancel\u00e1\u0159i skloubit otev\u0159enou spolupr\u00e1ci s m\u00edstem pro skute\u010dn\u00e9 soust\u0159ed\u011bn\u00ed?\n{hashtag|\\#|u1spacedesign} {hashtag|\\#|akustika} {hashtag|\\#|akustickypanel}\n","media_url":"https:\/\/media.licdn.com\/dms\/image\/v2\/D5622AQHdPTuVbocCMw\/feedshare-shrink_1280\/B56Z.hye1oIUAM-\/0\/1785125793403?e=1791417600&v=beta&t=d_fc0xyefUS97zWiM7tjPyYcPmsxzntnvQCI7EXyu6w","createdAt":1785125794645},{"id":"urn:li:ugcPost:7484879229847986177","commentary":"B\u00fdval\u00fd pivovar v Hole\u0161ovic\u00edch. \u010cern\u00fd strop pln\u00fd technologi\u00ed. A pod n\u00edm pastelov\u00fd interi\u00e9r.\n\nKapitol hledal v Praze nov\u00e9 kancel\u00e1\u0159e pro veden\u00ed i cel\u00fd t\u00fdm. Spole\u010dn\u011b jsme pro\u0161li n\u011bkolik adres a pro ka\u017edou p\u0159ipravili testovac\u00ed spaceplan.\n\nVyhr\u00e1l Hole\u0161ovick\u00fd pivovar.\n\nKv\u016fli lokalit\u011b. Kv\u016fli historii. Kv\u016fli atmosf\u00e9\u0159e.\n\nOd za\u010d\u00e1tku bylo jasn\u00e9, \u017ee prostor m\u00e1 vlastn\u00ed hlas. P\u0159iznan\u00e9 rozvody, \u010dern\u00fd strop, kov a v\u00fdrazn\u00e9 struktury. Identitu Kapitolu jsme do n\u011bj propsali jemn\u011bji. Pastelovou modrou a zelenou, d\u0159evem, obl\u00fdmi tvary n\u00e1bytku a sv\u011btlem, kter\u00e9 zv\u00fdraz\u0148uje jednotliv\u00e9 detaily.\n\nNa m\u00edru vznikl kovov\u00fd obklad s logem, d\u00fdhovan\u00e9 obklady i atypick\u00fd n\u00e1bytek.\nDispozice vyu\u017e\u00edv\u00e1 ka\u017ed\u00fd metr. Na vstup navazuje lounge, vedle n\u011bj dv\u011b \u0159editelsk\u00e9 kancel\u00e1\u0159e. Phoneboxy a copy centrum jsme um\u00edstili do st\u0159edu prostoru. Zasedac\u00ed m\u00edstnost se otev\u00edr\u00e1 sm\u011brem k lounge a ob\u011b z\u00f3ny si d\u00edky tomu navz\u00e1jem prop\u016fj\u010duj\u00ed vzdu\u0161nost a velkorysost.\n\nA potom p\u0159i\u0161la na \u0159adu akustika.\n\nP\u0159iznan\u00fd strop d\u00e1v\u00e1 kancel\u00e1\u0159i charakter, z\u00e1rove\u0148 ale vy\u017eaduje promy\u0161len\u00e9 \u0159e\u0161en\u00ed hluku. Proto jsme doplnili plst\u011bn\u00e9 lamely, koberce, z\u00e1v\u011bsy a \u010daloun\u011bn\u00fd n\u00e1bytek.\n\nMateri\u00e1l. Sv\u011btlo. Akustika.\n\nZa projektem stoj\u00ed t\u00fdm @[U1 space design](urn:li:organization:18790224). @[Michal Gr\u00f3f](urn:li:person:oOS1SbGRtO) vedl projekt a dr\u017eel celkovou koordinaci realizace. @[Veronika Muzik\u00e1\u0159ov\u00e1](urn:li:person:SmE2P7YYr8) st\u00e1la za n\u00e1vrhem cel\u00e9ho interi\u00e9ru. Od prvn\u00edch skic p\u0159es dispozici a materi\u00e1lov\u00e9 \u0159e\u0161en\u00ed a\u017e po n\u00e1vrh typov\u00e9ho i atypick\u00e9ho n\u00e1bytku. Eva Trs dr\u017eela rozpo\u010dty a objedn\u00e1vky, aby v\u0161echno sed\u011blo tak\u00e9 v \u010d\u00edslech.\n\nD\u011bkujeme panu Pobudovi a cel\u00e9mu t\u00fdmu @[KAPITOL, a.s.](urn:li:organization:18563053) za d\u016fv\u011bru, otev\u0159enost a spolupr\u00e1ci, d\u00edky kter\u00e9 jsme mohli prostor dot\u00e1hnout od prvn\u00ed my\u0161lenky a\u017e po posledn\u00ed detail.\n\nDobr\u00fd interi\u00e9r podle n\u00e1s vznik\u00e1 ve chv\u00edli, kdy m\u00edsto a firma za\u010dnou mluvit stejn\u00fdm jazykem.\n\nTady je to vid\u011bt hned ode dve\u0159\u00ed.\n\nKter\u00fd detail podle v\u00e1s nejv\u00edc ovliv\u0148uje prvn\u00ed dojem z kancel\u00e1\u0159e?\n\nFotografie: @[Jan Kudej](urn:li:person:BtYqOiFjg9) \n \n{hashtag|\\#|u1spacedesign} {hashtag|\\#|fitout} {hashtag|\\#|workplace}","media_url":"https:\/\/media.licdn.com\/dms\/image\/v2\/D4D22AQGzt6XWH2f2gA\/feedshare-shrink_1280\/B4DZ9.h7A2IIAM-\/0\/1784534250355?e=1791417600&v=beta&t=xy3gOSYH6ifyU3VSPgtama9FkfhLT1JPOP8_6Tm6qaQ","createdAt":1784534270970},{"id":"urn:li:ugcPost:7483261947925151744","commentary":"Na chv\u00edli se zastavte a nechte prostor promluvit.\n\nTakov\u00e1 je atmosf\u00e9ra nov\u00fdch kancel\u00e1\u0159\u00ed @[KAPITOL, a.s.](urn:li:organization:18563053) v hole\u0161ovick\u00e9m pivovaru.\nKompletn\u00ed realizaci, detailn\u00ed fotografie i cel\u00fd p\u0159\u00edb\u011bh projektu p\u0159edstav\u00edme u\u017e v pond\u011bl\u00ed.\n\nJak na v\u00e1s prostor p\u016fsob\u00ed?","media_url":"https:\/\/media.licdn.com\/dms\/image\/v2\/D4D05AQFYv3HCgGjjOQ\/videocover-high\/B4DZ9njV4hHgBM-\/0\/1784148749691?e=1790251200&v=beta&t=ImTiMxCS6gZHgX9aC9aLS47wTw_140qICU8ExfMuSJg","createdAt":1784148680895},{"id":"urn:li:ugcPost:7480015739228368896","commentary":"D\u011btsk\u00e9 h\u0159i\u0161t\u011b na st\u0159e\u0161e parkovac\u00edho domu.\nSv\u011bteln\u00e1 instalace ve stalet\u00fdch klenb\u00e1ch.\nA mezi t\u00edm Koda\u0148 na kole.\n\nKa\u017ed\u00fd \u010derven se Koda\u0148 prom\u011bn\u00ed v jeden velk\u00fd showroom. 3daysofdesign otev\u0159e stovky showroom\u016f, ateli\u00e9r\u016f a instalac\u00ed nap\u0159\u00ed\u010d m\u011bstem. Na\u0161i design\u00e9\u0159i tam letos vyrazili na\u010derpat inspiraci, sledovat aktu\u00e1ln\u00ed trendy a za\u017e\u00edt m\u011bsto, kter\u00e9 s designem pracuje \u00fapln\u011b p\u0159irozen\u011b.\n\nA proto\u017ee Koda\u0148 se nejl\u00e9pe ch\u00e1pe ze sedla, p\u016fj\u010dili si hned prvn\u00ed den kola.\n\nFoto 1: Za\u010dalo to ob\u011bdem v IKEA Vesterbro. I j\u00eddelna s t\u00e1cy tu m\u00e1 v\u00fdhled na most, po kter\u00e9m jezd\u00ed v\u00edc kol ne\u017e aut.\n\n2: Kola hned prvn\u00ed den. Jinak se festival stihnout ned\u00e1. V Kodani jsou sou\u010d\u00e1st rytmu m\u011bsta.\n\n3 a 4: Konditaget L\u00fcders od JAJA Architects. Parkovac\u00ed d\u016fm se st\u0159e\u0161n\u00edm h\u0159i\u0161t\u011bm a b\u011b\u017eeckou dr\u00e1hou. D\u016fkaz, \u017ee dobr\u00fd prostor nekon\u010d\u00ed u sv\u00e9 p\u016fvodn\u00ed funkce.\n\n5: HAY House. Modr\u00e1 ocelov\u00e1 konstrukce reg\u00e1l\u016f pod \u0161tukov\u00fdm stropem. Nov\u00fd syst\u00e9m v historick\u00e9m prostoru, a p\u0159esto spolu v\u0161echno p\u0159irozen\u011b mluv\u00ed.\n\n6: Normann Copenhagen s v\u00fdstavou THE GRID. Modul\u00e1rn\u00ed sezen\u00ed pod syrov\u00fdm betonem. Tvary, kter\u00e9 se p\u0159izp\u016fsob\u00ed tomu, jak pr\u00e1v\u011b pracujete nebo se potk\u00e1v\u00e1te.\n\n7: Designmuseum Danmark. Leskl\u00fd kov, organick\u00e9 tvary a p\u0159ipom\u00ednka, jak dlouhou a silnou tradici tu \u0159emeslo m\u00e1.\n\n8: K\u00e1va v La Cabra v Nordhavnu, aktu\u00e1ln\u011b asi nejv\u00edc hype kav\u00e1rn\u011b v Kodani. Minimalismus do posledn\u00edho detailu. Fronta a\u017e ven, opr\u00e1vn\u011bn\u011b.\n\n9: Showroom Vitra a pocta Vernerovi Pantonovi. Vlnit\u00fd koberec, organick\u00e9 seda\u010dky, syt\u00e9 barvy. Sedmdes\u00e1tky odv\u00e1\u017en\u011bj\u0161\u00ed ne\u017e v\u011bt\u0161ina dne\u0161n\u00edch novinek.\n\n10 a\u017e 12: Ateli\u00e9r BIG, studio Bjarke Ingelse. Hedonistick\u00e1 udr\u017eitelnost v praxi: ekologick\u00e1 stavba m\u00e1 lidi hlavn\u011b bavit. Stoly pln\u00e9 model\u016f, nad hlavou \u010dern\u00e1 schodi\u0161t\u011b. Kancel\u00e1\u0159 jako manifest.\n\n13: V AKUART jsme dostali v\u00fdklad o akustick\u00fdch panelech. Na\u0161e denn\u00ed t\u00e9ma. Proto\u017ee kr\u00e1sn\u00fd prostor nesta\u010d\u00ed. Mus\u00ed se v n\u011bm dob\u0159e mluvit, pracovat a soust\u0159edit.\n\n14: Aalto 90 Pavilion od Iittaly. V\u00e1za Alvara Aalta zv\u011bt\u0161en\u00e1 do pochoz\u00edho pavilonu z n\u00edzkouhl\u00edkov\u00e9ho hlin\u00edku. Stoj\u00edte uvnit\u0159 ikony a stropem kouk\u00e1 nebe.\n\n15: POPUP FRAMA v b\u00fdval\u00e9 l\u00e9k\u00e1rn\u011b. P\u016fvodn\u00ed reg\u00e1ly, malovan\u00fd strop a mezi t\u00edm sou\u010dasn\u00e9 objekty. Nic nek\u0159i\u010d\u00ed. Ka\u017ed\u00fd detail m\u00e1 svoje m\u00edsto.\n\n16: Kaktus Towers od BIG. Dv\u011b v\u011b\u017ee propojen\u00e9 vyv\u00fd\u0161en\u00fdm parkem. Foceno ze sedla, samoz\u0159ejm\u011b.\n\n17: Nejsiln\u011bj\u0161\u00ed moment cesty. Instalace CENTER od Vibia v kostele Helligaandshuset. Sou\u010dasn\u00e9 sv\u011btlo ve stalet\u00fdch klenb\u00e1ch. Ticho uprost\u0159ed ru\u0161n\u00e9ho festivalu.\n\n18: Franti\u0161ek a Filip a zaslou\u017een\u00e1 pauza na k\u00e1vu p\u0159ed showroomem YLLW. I stolek je tu expon\u00e1t.\n\n19: Paper Island a platforma Deoron.\n\n20: A ve\u010der? Hudba hr\u00e1la dob\u0159e, pit\u00ed bylo o n\u011bco dra\u017e\u0161\u00ed ne\u017e doma a Franti\u0161ka se m\u00edstn\u00ed ptali, jestli nen\u00ed z Balk\u00e1nu.\n\nZ Kodan\u011b jsme si nevezli produkty.\n\nVezli jsme si zp\u016fsob p\u0159em\u00fd\u0161len\u00ed.\nO prostoru. O sv\u011btle. O detailu.\nA o tom, jak moc prost\u0159ed\u00ed ovliv\u0148uje, jak se v n\u011bm c\u00edt\u00edme.\n\n@[Radek Ma\u0161inda](urn:li:person:L3tw2Wy41x), @[Filip Dr\u00e1pal](urn:li:person:EUfGFIvESd), @[Tereza Maty\u00e1\u0161kov\u00e1](urn:li:person:PXeRT2ZKGM), Franti\u0161ek Nov\u00e1k","media_url":"https:\/\/media.licdn.com\/dms\/image\/v2\/D4D22AQHqiaKTZ8BvgA\/feedshare-shrink_1280\/B4DZ85aqriHQAM-\/0\/1783374720897?e=1791417600&v=beta&t=1kv4chrpv8OToti_zXkeHG1vh5umxusXhl56X3Kf6JM","createdAt":1783374724555},{"id":"urn:li:ugcPost:7477358152439685123","commentary":"Pr\u016fb\u011bh realizace pro @[MADFINGER Games, a.s.](urn:li:organization:802910)\nJak prob\u00edhala prvn\u00ed etapa rekonstrukce a v jak\u00e9 f\u00e1zi se zak\u00e1zka aktu\u00e1ln\u011b nach\u00e1z\u00ed? \n\nO tom n\u00e1m v\u00edce \u0159ekl n\u00e1\u0161 projektov\u00fd mana\u017eer @[Martin \u010cuhel](urn:li:person:cdBQPHYU6n), kter\u00fd m\u00e1 realizaci na starosti p\u0159\u00edmo na m\u00edst\u011b.\n\nNa za\u010d\u00e1tku jsme pracovali p\u0159edev\u0161\u00edm s \u010d\u00e1st\u00ed kancel\u00e1\u0159\u00ed, kter\u00e1 nebyla ob\u00fdvan\u00e1. Z\u00e1rove\u0148 ale bylo nutn\u00e9 nav\u00e1zat na prostory, kde u\u017e t\u00fdm @[MADFINGER Games, a.s.](urn:li:organization:802910) b\u011b\u017en\u011b fungoval. Jednou z hlavn\u00edch v\u00fdzev proto bylo bezpe\u010dn\u00e9 odd\u011blen\u00ed stavby od provozu tak, aby mohla rekonstrukce pokra\u010dovat a z\u00e1rove\u0148 nebyl naru\u0161en ka\u017edodenn\u00ed chod firmy.\n\nV prvn\u00ed etap\u011b prob\u00edhala demont\u00e1\u017e p\u016fvodn\u00edch podhled\u016f, d\u00edky \u010demu\u017e mohly z\u016fstat p\u0159iznan\u00e9 technick\u00e9 instalace. Ty se n\u00e1sledn\u011b sjednotily n\u00e1st\u0159ikem a staly se sou\u010d\u00e1st\u00ed budouc\u00edho v\u00fdrazu interi\u00e9ru.\n\nRozeb\u00edrala se tak\u00e9 p\u016fvodn\u00ed podlaha, aby bylo mo\u017en\u00e9 nov\u00e9 p\u0159\u00ed\u010dky kotvit a\u017e na beton. Tento krok m\u00e1 velk\u00fd v\u00fdznam i z hlediska akustiky. Spr\u00e1vn\u00e9 napojen\u00ed p\u0159\u00ed\u010dek na nosnou konstrukci pom\u00e1h\u00e1 omezit p\u0159enos hluku mezi m\u00edstnostmi a zvy\u0161uje komfort cel\u00e9ho pracovn\u00edho prost\u0159ed\u00ed.\n\nD\u016fle\u017eit\u00fdm t\u00e9matem byla i celkov\u00e1 atmosf\u00e9ra interi\u00e9ru. N\u00e1vrh pracuje s tmav\u0161\u00ed barevnost\u00ed, a proto bylo pot\u0159eba dob\u0159e vy\u0159e\u0161it osv\u011btlen\u00ed tak, aby prostor nep\u016fsobil t\u011b\u017ece. U\u017e v t\u00e9to f\u00e1zi je vid\u011bt, \u017ee kombinace tmav\u00fdch ploch, d\u0159eva a spr\u00e1vn\u011b rozm\u00edst\u011bn\u00e9ho sv\u011btla d\u00e1v\u00e1 prostoru v\u00fdrazn\u00fd charakter.\n\nNejde je\u0161t\u011b o fin\u00e1ln\u00ed podobu realizace, ale pr\u00e1v\u011b pr\u016fb\u011b\u017en\u00e9 f\u00e1ze dob\u0159e ukazuj\u00ed, kolik technick\u00e9 p\u0159\u00edpravy, koordinace a detailn\u00edho pl\u00e1nov\u00e1n\u00ed stoj\u00ed za v\u00fdsledkem, kter\u00fd bude na konci p\u016fsobit p\u0159irozen\u011b, funk\u010dn\u011b a promy\u0161len\u011b.\n\nD\u011bkujeme t\u00fdmu MADFINGER Games za skv\u011blou spolupr\u00e1ci a otev\u0159en\u00fd p\u0159\u00edstup b\u011bhem cel\u00e9 realizace. Pr\u00e1v\u011b vz\u00e1jemn\u00e1 d\u016fv\u011bra a dobr\u00e1 komunikace jsou u podobn\u00fdch projekt\u016f z\u00e1sadn\u00ed.\n\nFin\u00e1ln\u00ed podobu projektu uk\u00e1\u017eeme brzy.\n\n{hashtag|\\#|MADFINGERGames} {hashtag|\\#|u1spacedesign} {hashtag|\\#|prubehrealizace}","media_url":"","createdAt":1782741106497},{"id":"urn:li:ugcPost:7475191645961908224","commentary":"Dubov\u00e9 parkety do strome\u010dku. Betonov\u00fd sloup nechan\u00fd v surov\u00e9 podob\u011b. A kolem n\u011bj barov\u00fd ostrov se \u0161edozelenou deskou.\nLobby v budov\u011b IQ Ostrava od @[CTP Czech](urn:li:organization:69230059).\nProstor, kter\u00fd se neboj\u00ed kombinovat. Industri\u00e1ln\u00ed skelet budovy tady z\u016fstal p\u0159iznan\u00fd. Betonov\u00e9 sloupy s hrubou texturou, rozvody na strop\u011b, chladn\u00e9 monochromatick\u00e9 pozad\u00ed. Proti n\u011bmu teplo a \u0159emeslo v \u00farovni o\u010d\u00ed. Dubov\u00e1 podlaha, masivn\u00ed d\u0159evo, ko\u017een\u00e9 \u010daloun\u011bn\u00ed.\n\nM\u00edsto jednoho typu sezen\u00ed jich je tu v\u00edc. Barov\u00fd ostrov obto\u010den\u00fd kolem sloupu na rychlou rann\u00ed k\u00e1vu. Ko\u017een\u00e9 boxy v tmav\u011b modr\u00fdch nik\u00e1ch s perforovan\u00fdm rastrem a malbou za z\u00e1dy pro klidn\u011bj\u0161\u00ed ob\u011bd ve dvou. Jeden prostor. V\u00edc zp\u016fsob\u016f, jak v n\u011bm b\u00fdt.\n\nArchitektonick\u00fd n\u00e1vrh cel\u00e9ho projektu m\u011blo na starosti @[Studio acht Architects](urn:li:organization:77583550). Koncept, dispozice, materi\u00e1ly, atmosf\u00e9ra. Odvaha postavit vedle sebe geometrii perforovan\u00fdch z\u00e1st\u011bn, organick\u00fd flor\u00e1l na \u010daloun\u011bn\u00ed lavic a expresivn\u00ed malbu na celou st\u011bnu. My jsme se postarali o realizaci. O to, aby se z n\u00e1vrhu stal prostor, kter\u00fd zvl\u00e1dne ka\u017edodenn\u00ed provoz.\n\nDr\u017e\u00ed to d\u00edky kvalit\u011b materi\u00e1l\u016f a detailu. T\u0159eba subtiln\u00ed \u010derven\u00e9 oh\u00fdban\u00e9 podno\u017e\u00ed u \u017eidl\u00ed. Mali\u010dkost, na kterou se moc ned\u00edv\u00e1, a p\u0159itom celou tu pestrost scel\u00ed.\n\nMysl\u00edm, \u017ee rozmanitost n\u00e1bytku tady nen\u00ed jen dekorace. Funguje jako tich\u00e9 z\u00f3nov\u00e1n\u00ed. \u010clov\u011bk si vybere m\u00edsto podle toho, co zrovna pot\u0159ebuje. S\u00e1m, ve dvou, ve v\u011bt\u0161\u00ed skupin\u011b.\n\nFunguje. Vydr\u017e\u00ed. D\u00e1v\u00e1 smysl.\n\nKde u v\u00e1s v pr\u00e1ci j\u00edte ob\u011bd? U sv\u00e9ho stolu, nebo si vyberete m\u00edsto podle n\u00e1lady?\n\nZa t\u00fdm U1 se na projektu pod\u00edleli @[Jaroslav Graf](urn:li:person:vX-OmyKbLx) za obchodn\u00ed \u010d\u00e1st projektu, @[Tom\u00e1\u0161 Hel\u00e1n](urn:li:person:wlBns03aT2) za projektov\u00e9 veden\u00ed a koordinaci realizace, @[Tereza Maty\u00e1\u0161kov\u00e1](urn:li:person:PXeRT2ZKGM) za typov\u00fd a atypick\u00fd n\u00e1bytek a Tom\u00e1\u0161 Loup za business support, rozpo\u010dty a objedn\u00e1vky.\n\n{hashtag|\\#|u1spacedesign} {hashtag|\\#|fitout} {hashtag|\\#|workplace}","media_url":"https:\/\/media.licdn.com\/dms\/image\/v2\/D5622AQHfi2bxKhwWYg\/feedshare-shrink_1280\/B56Z703LJ9HUAM-\/0\/1782224565611?e=1791417600&v=beta&t=w3sn446LkPJkk3gHS7lCFWDJwQ_yx7DnXmjPohZ6s00","createdAt":1782224571037}]}